@host = http://localhost:5132
@apiKey = dev-key
@build = IU-252.25557.131

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Upload a plugin (raw body)
POST {{host}}/api/plugins/upload?filename=my-plugin-1.0.0.zip
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./my-plugin-1.0.0.zip

### List plugins
GET {{host}}/api/plugins

### Marketplace search, as the IDE sends it
GET {{host}}/api/search/plugins?orderBy=downloads&build={{build}}&max=20&all=false

### Update check (2024.2+ IDEs)
GET {{host}}/api/search/updates/compatible?build={{build}}&pluginXmlId=com.example.plugin

### Update check (older IDEs)
POST {{host}}/api/search/compatibleUpdates
Content-Type: application/json

{"build": "{{build}}", "pluginXMLIds": ["com.example.plugin"]}

### Download (redirects to /files/...)
GET {{host}}/pluginManager?id=com.example.plugin&build={{build}}

### Classic custom repository XML
GET {{host}}/updatePlugins.xml?build={{build}}

### Delete a version
DELETE {{host}}/api/plugins/com.example.plugin/1.0.0
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
